WEBVTT

00:11.544 --> 00:15.105
Hanaukyo Maid Team

00:15.749 --> 00:21.153
Asa no mado wo aketanara.

00:21.221 --> 00:28.150
Hikari no hana
sekai wo tsutsumu.

00:29.195 --> 00:35.100
Mune no naka ni nemutte iru...

00:35.168 --> 00:41.596
...omoi ga ima tokete ikuyou.

00:43.176 --> 00:48.273
Kisetsu no nioi dakishimeteru.

00:49.182 --> 00:55.781
Anata ni negatte...

00:55.855 --> 00:58.790
Aitakatta...

00:58.858 --> 01:02.589
...umareta hi kara zutto.

01:02.662 --> 01:05.529
Anata hitori...

01:05.598 --> 01:09.967
...mamoritai hito ga iru.

01:10.036 --> 01:12.402
Anata dake...

01:12.472 --> 01:14.406
...furetai.

01:15.709 --> 01:20.612
Kono te wo tsunaguno.

01:22.482 --> 01:24.143
Todoketai.

01:25.852 --> 01:27.945
Voice of my heart.

01:36.796 --> 01:37.888
Mariel's data?

01:37.964 --> 01:40.023
Yes, can you pull it up?

01:40.100 --> 01:41.362
Of course.

01:41.434 --> 01:43.368
What do you think this Memol is?

01:43.436 --> 01:48.305
If I wanted to, I could break
into the CIA's computer, too.

01:48.375 --> 01:50.343
Mariel's data...

01:51.978 --> 01:52.945
Access denied?

01:54.981 --> 01:56.005
Ridiculous!

01:56.082 --> 01:58.550
There's no data I can't access...

02:03.757 --> 02:04.849
I knew it.

02:19.539 --> 02:21.268
Mariel...

02:21.341 --> 02:22.569
Who are you...

02:25.445 --> 02:28.039
Sorry to bother you so late...

02:29.215 --> 02:30.546
Taro-sama.

02:30.617 --> 02:34.018
I have a favor to ask, Konoe-san.

02:34.087 --> 02:38.990
Woman in a Sports Car

02:41.961 --> 02:43.690
Well then, I'm going.

02:43.763 --> 02:44.957
Don't go!

02:45.031 --> 02:46.055
Don't leave!

02:46.132 --> 02:47.360
I'll kill myself!

02:48.435 --> 02:50.562
I'm coming back
early this evening.

02:53.506 --> 02:54.530
You're going out?

02:54.607 --> 02:55.904
Yeah.

02:55.975 --> 02:57.966
I have a few things
to think about alone.

02:58.044 --> 03:01.946
I want to go to the Kamakura
area that my mother liked.

03:02.015 --> 03:04.882
A few things to think about...

03:05.852 --> 03:06.614
Taro-sama.

03:09.656 --> 03:11.556
Bento and herb tea.

03:12.859 --> 03:14.326
Just a minute.

03:15.061 --> 03:17.052
I won't let you
get the jump on me.

03:17.130 --> 03:22.796
If you want a bento, take this
Jihioh special fifty level bento!

03:31.311 --> 03:33.176
Oops... Oops...

03:33.246 --> 03:35.305
Oops...

03:35.381 --> 03:40.512
Oops... O-Oops...

03:40.587 --> 03:41.918
She's a fool.

03:42.989 --> 03:43.956
Oh, yes.

03:44.023 --> 03:45.490
Everyone already knows.

03:45.558 --> 03:47.924
Did you make this, Mariel?

03:48.695 --> 03:50.219
Yes.

03:50.296 --> 03:51.320
Thank you.

03:56.002 --> 03:56.900
Konoe-san.

03:57.937 --> 03:59.268
I'm sorry for being selfish.

03:59.339 --> 04:02.706
I'll call you right away
if anything happens.

04:02.775 --> 04:04.675
Yes, please be careful.

04:04.744 --> 04:06.609
Then I'm off.

04:13.119 --> 04:16.919
Make sure to protect
Taro-sama without being noticed.

04:16.990 --> 04:17.922
Yes, ma'am!

04:20.560 --> 04:21.527
Taro-sama...

05:11.678 --> 05:12.975
It's you, Fenrir...

05:19.953 --> 05:22.046
Oh, good boy, good boy.

05:26.526 --> 05:27.458
What's wrong...

05:43.977 --> 05:46.207
Our eyes don't meet yet.

05:48.381 --> 05:49.780
Good!

05:51.651 --> 05:52.743
This is perfect.

05:54.320 --> 05:55.719
Yashima, it's morning.

05:55.788 --> 05:56.812
Get up.

05:56.889 --> 05:58.254
Yashima, it's morning.

05:58.324 --> 05:58.847
Get up.

05:58.925 --> 06:01.689
A morning surrounded
by Konoe-shama...

06:03.496 --> 06:05.020
Yashima, are you in?

06:06.466 --> 06:07.831
I-It can't be...

06:13.172 --> 06:17.233
I'm sorry to bother you on your
day off. Can we talk a little?

06:18.411 --> 06:19.810
Y-Yes, what is it?

06:19.879 --> 06:23.337
I'm sorry, but may
I borrow some clothes?

06:23.416 --> 06:26.180
My spare is still being washed.

06:26.252 --> 06:28.777
I'm sure it will be dry soon.

06:28.855 --> 06:30.550
Clothes? Leader?

06:30.623 --> 06:32.250
My clothes?

06:32.325 --> 06:33.087
You can't?

06:33.159 --> 06:34.888
No, I'll bring it right away!

06:36.663 --> 06:39.223
Um, please go
to the changing room.

06:43.870 --> 06:45.360
T-This is...

06:45.438 --> 06:47.235
You look good. You're pretty.

06:47.306 --> 06:48.739
You're pretty, Leader!

06:49.475 --> 06:52.137
But it's a little difficult to move.

06:52.211 --> 06:53.610
Do you have another?

06:53.680 --> 06:54.669
I see.

06:54.747 --> 06:55.771
Then...

06:56.749 --> 06:59.479
Isn't this a school uniform?

07:00.153 --> 07:01.484
How is it?

07:01.554 --> 07:03.112
Not bad, but...

07:04.190 --> 07:06.920
Why are you wearing
a school uniform, too?

07:06.993 --> 07:09.894
Well, I didn't have
a chance to be a student...

07:09.962 --> 07:12.294
...and I've wanted
to wear this once.

07:12.365 --> 07:16.529
And Leader,
I have a favor to ask you.

07:16.602 --> 07:17.728
What is it?

07:22.442 --> 07:23.670
Well, I don't mind...

07:23.743 --> 07:24.971
Then...

07:26.979 --> 07:30.107
K-Konoe-senpai.

07:30.183 --> 07:32.048
What is it, Yashima?

07:33.986 --> 07:37.149
What a wonderful life I have...

07:39.592 --> 07:41.116
Hey...

07:41.194 --> 07:43.458
Then next...

07:44.330 --> 07:46.457
Peace for a good master.

07:47.233 --> 07:49.463
Punishment for a bad master.

07:50.369 --> 07:52.234
With love, justice, and service.

07:52.305 --> 07:54.671
Maid Angel Konoerina...

07:54.741 --> 07:55.935
...is here!

07:57.043 --> 07:58.203
Konoe-shama, I love you!

07:58.277 --> 07:59.073
Bonk

07:59.145 --> 08:00.908
This is too much, after all.

08:00.980 --> 08:02.914
How about this?

08:04.951 --> 08:07.351
This is all right...

08:07.420 --> 08:12.255
After all, I look the best
in these kinds of clothes.

08:14.393 --> 08:16.861
Yashima,
how about lunch with me?

08:19.532 --> 08:20.396
With pleasure!

08:34.347 --> 08:36.144
I'm glad it cleared up.

08:43.222 --> 08:46.248
Taro-sama has
gotten off the train.

08:46.325 --> 08:48.225
We'll keep following him...

08:57.837 --> 08:59.099
What happened...

09:05.478 --> 09:06.911
Preparations are complete.

09:14.287 --> 09:15.311
Taro-sama?

09:15.388 --> 09:20.451
Yes, does he seem different
somehow or distressed?

09:21.561 --> 09:22.823
Not really...

09:22.895 --> 09:24.328
I see.

09:24.397 --> 09:26.763
How about Mariel
and Taro-sama?

09:26.833 --> 09:28.266
What do you mean?

09:28.334 --> 09:31.462
Well, the situation
between the two...

09:31.537 --> 09:33.664
How should I put it...

09:33.739 --> 09:34.899
No, never mind.

09:39.679 --> 09:40.611
Leader.

09:41.514 --> 09:43.880
Do you like Taro-sama?

09:44.684 --> 09:47.312
W-What are you saying?

09:47.386 --> 09:51.288
Because you've only been
talking about Taro-sama!

09:51.357 --> 09:52.483
And Mariel-sama!

09:53.559 --> 09:55.026
Leader!

09:56.863 --> 09:58.262
Don't be silly.

10:02.668 --> 10:05.159
I'm sorry to bother
you during lunch.

10:05.238 --> 10:08.935
I told you to bring me
bad news more quickly.

10:09.008 --> 10:10.236
- Tell me.
- Right.

10:10.309 --> 10:14.075
At 12:30 today, we lost
Taro-sama in Kamakura.

10:15.648 --> 10:16.910
Huh?

10:16.983 --> 10:19.008
Why isn't anyone answering?

10:19.085 --> 10:20.780
Is everyone out?

10:29.662 --> 10:31.493
Which way was the station?

10:47.046 --> 10:48.707
Do you need a ride?

10:51.017 --> 10:55.886
Hanaukyo Maid Team

10:57.223 --> 10:58.554
Status report!

10:58.624 --> 11:00.854
We can't catch
the signal from Taro-sama.

11:00.927 --> 11:04.624
- Special guard team is silent.
- Switch to Satellite Nolun.

11:04.697 --> 11:06.324
I'm sure he hasn't gotten far yet.

11:06.399 --> 11:07.832
Yes, ma'am.

11:08.601 --> 11:11.092
No response from Nolun.

11:11.170 --> 11:15.368
The main, sub, and urgent
circuits are all cut off.

11:15.441 --> 11:17.272
It's not accepting our signal.

11:17.343 --> 11:18.435
What?

11:21.580 --> 11:23.810
Did you find Taro-sama?

11:23.883 --> 11:28.149
Really, that midget should think
about how he's bothering people.

11:28.220 --> 11:29.687
Bothering people?

11:29.755 --> 11:32.155
How dare you say that.

11:32.224 --> 11:33.452
What was that?

11:37.697 --> 11:38.664
Yashima.

11:38.731 --> 11:40.028
Yes, ma'am.

11:40.099 --> 11:42.158
I'm giving you a special task.

11:42.234 --> 11:45.294
Quickly collect the information
gathered by the info...

11:45.371 --> 11:47.066
...and security departments.

11:47.139 --> 11:48.299
It's urgent.

11:48.374 --> 11:49.363
Yes, ma'am.

11:51.877 --> 11:52.969
Leader...

11:54.146 --> 11:56.273
Shut up, you guys!

11:58.317 --> 12:02.583
The Hanaukyo family's security
system is equal to a national level.

12:02.655 --> 12:05.180
How could it be
jammed this much...

12:07.026 --> 12:08.288
It can't be...

12:12.164 --> 12:16.726
You have pretty good guts
to challenge Grace-sama.

12:16.802 --> 12:17.928
How is it?

12:18.004 --> 12:19.733
It's outrageous hacking.

12:19.805 --> 12:24.799
But Memol can't lose with the
world's fastest arithmetic ability.

12:25.878 --> 12:27.709
This should finish it!

12:29.148 --> 12:31.048
What? A trap?

12:38.457 --> 12:40.789
Don't think you can
make a fool of me...

12:40.860 --> 12:42.157
Elder Sister...

12:57.543 --> 13:01.343
From today,
your name is Konoe Tsurugi.

13:01.414 --> 13:03.245
You are to be my sister.

13:10.289 --> 13:12.587
Drop your guard and you'll die.

13:20.633 --> 13:22.794
Throw kindness away.

13:41.987 --> 13:43.454
Go.

13:43.522 --> 13:45.717
To the master who deserves you.

13:48.894 --> 13:50.691
Grace...

13:50.763 --> 13:53.129
The opponent is
the Red King Flag.

13:53.199 --> 13:54.564
What?

13:56.135 --> 13:57.397
There's no mistake.

13:58.904 --> 14:01.099
Hokusai Hanaukyo's
bodyguards...

14:01.173 --> 14:02.834
...the Red King Flag.

14:02.908 --> 14:06.002
The 12 proud soldiers
whose roots are said...

14:06.078 --> 14:08.569
...to go back to
the Three Big Knights.

14:08.647 --> 14:11.115
The one who
commands the group is...

14:11.183 --> 14:12.707
...Shikoh-In.

14:14.553 --> 14:16.714
Such a group...

14:16.789 --> 14:17.949
What's their goal?

14:18.023 --> 14:19.456
I don't know.

14:19.525 --> 14:22.392
But they must be
linked to this incident.

14:22.461 --> 14:24.986
The underground disturbance...

14:25.064 --> 14:27.760
And the tightly secured
data inside Memol...

14:28.467 --> 14:31.766
The center of those
incidents must be...

14:37.643 --> 14:38.769
Mariel...

14:40.112 --> 14:42.512
Thank you for giving me a ride.

14:43.582 --> 14:46.449
I offered the ride,
so don't mention it.

14:47.653 --> 14:49.814
Where were you headed?

14:49.889 --> 14:51.413
Nowhere.

14:51.490 --> 14:52.787
It's just a whim.

14:54.493 --> 14:55.323
And you?

14:55.394 --> 14:56.486
Well...

14:56.562 --> 14:59.929
I have a few things
I want to think about alone...

14:59.999 --> 15:01.967
Love problems?

15:02.034 --> 15:03.763
Maybe so...

15:03.836 --> 15:06.566
I don't even know myself.

15:13.045 --> 15:14.910
Konoe-san, aren't you going?

15:15.981 --> 15:17.915
No, I...

15:17.983 --> 15:19.211
Go.

15:19.285 --> 15:21.617
Go, Konoe Tsurugi.

15:22.521 --> 15:24.079
Taro-sama is waiting.

15:25.090 --> 15:25.886
Wait...

15:27.326 --> 15:29.590
I want you to tell me one thing.

15:30.663 --> 15:33.063
How do you feel
about Taro-sama?

15:37.336 --> 15:40.203
Everything is as
Taro-sama wishes.

15:47.146 --> 15:48.238
Taro-sama...

15:50.249 --> 15:52.240
I feel strange somehow.

15:53.485 --> 15:56.477
I feel like this isn't the first
time we've met, miss.

15:56.555 --> 15:59.285
Are you flirting with me?

15:59.358 --> 16:01.519
N-No, it's not that...

16:01.594 --> 16:02.686
That's too bad.

16:04.330 --> 16:07.458
You look just like my first love.

16:07.533 --> 16:09.763
That's why I gave you a ride.

16:10.836 --> 16:12.133
Is that so...

16:13.539 --> 16:17.100
Then I'll treat you
to some tea to thank you.

16:23.482 --> 16:24.813
Herb tea, eh?

16:24.883 --> 16:26.214
Yes.

16:26.285 --> 16:29.982
The person who prepared
that tea is very kind.

16:31.056 --> 16:32.114
And warm...

16:33.192 --> 16:35.126
And always cheers me up.

16:36.729 --> 16:38.720
I see. She's a good person.

16:38.797 --> 16:40.662
Yes, very much so...

16:40.733 --> 16:42.223
Do you like her?

16:43.802 --> 16:45.793
I don't know.

16:45.871 --> 16:48.806
But I feel relieved
when she's beside me.

16:48.874 --> 16:51.172
I have great peace of mind.

16:52.244 --> 16:55.372
That's why I want her
to stay beside me forever...

16:56.649 --> 16:57.707
I see.

16:57.783 --> 17:00.274
Does that mean I'm selfish?

17:00.352 --> 17:01.717
No.

17:01.787 --> 17:04.950
Everyone has moments
when they think like that.

17:06.025 --> 17:08.892
But nothing remains
unchanged forever.

17:15.200 --> 17:17.100
Even when it's in your hands...

17:17.169 --> 17:20.730
...it changes shape and
disappears before you know it.

17:22.474 --> 17:24.408
My first love died.

17:25.477 --> 17:26.808
I killed him.

17:28.814 --> 17:30.076
Don't be fooled.

17:30.149 --> 17:31.446
I was kidding.

17:31.517 --> 17:33.985
What's that? You surprised me.

17:34.053 --> 17:36.817
But it could happen...

17:36.889 --> 17:39.722
A person's feelings
are weaker than sand...

17:39.792 --> 17:41.692
...and easy to change.

17:43.429 --> 17:45.021
Excuse me a moment.

17:47.700 --> 17:51.693
Shikoh-In-sama, the protective
wall will be broken soon.

17:51.770 --> 17:52.634
Understood.

17:55.374 --> 17:58.434
Using Nolun's data from
before the cut circuits...

17:58.510 --> 18:00.341
...he must be in this direction.

18:00.412 --> 18:01.504
Keep going!

18:01.580 --> 18:02.308
Roger.

18:06.652 --> 18:07.949
Taro-sama...

18:08.020 --> 18:09.510
Please be unharmed.

18:10.989 --> 18:12.047
Thanks for waiting.

18:12.124 --> 18:14.718
I broke the protective wall.

18:14.793 --> 18:16.727
Here is Taro's location.

18:19.465 --> 18:21.660
He's ahead and nearby.

18:21.734 --> 18:22.598
As I thought.

18:22.668 --> 18:25.034
Good, go immediately.

18:26.538 --> 18:28.563
Is here really all right?

18:28.640 --> 18:29.868
Yes.

18:29.942 --> 18:31.500
I can go back alone from here.

18:32.711 --> 18:36.374
It looks like you've found
the answer to your problem.

18:36.448 --> 18:37.506
Yes.

18:38.751 --> 18:40.514
Oh, that's right.

18:40.586 --> 18:41.382
Hey.

18:47.493 --> 18:49.290
I'll give you this.

18:50.028 --> 18:50.960
And...

18:54.333 --> 18:55.857
Thank you.

18:55.934 --> 18:57.026
It was fun.

19:10.082 --> 19:11.845
Taro-sama!

19:11.917 --> 19:13.851
Oh, Konoe-san.

19:13.919 --> 19:15.250
Hi!

19:18.824 --> 19:19.916
Taro-sama!

19:21.360 --> 19:23.260
Sorry, I couldn't call...

19:23.328 --> 19:24.260
Taro-sama!

19:25.330 --> 19:27.127
K-Konoe-san...

19:35.641 --> 19:39.168
I'm glad you're unharmed.
You have no injuries?

19:39.244 --> 19:40.211
N-No.

19:42.915 --> 19:45.713
Oh, a lady gave that to me.

19:45.784 --> 19:48.082
I was with her
just a minute ago...

19:49.922 --> 19:51.389
Um, Konoe-san?

19:54.092 --> 19:55.491
Where's Mariel?

19:58.797 --> 20:00.697
I'm sorry, but she's not here.

20:02.568 --> 20:03.762
I see.

20:03.836 --> 20:05.895
Taro-sama!

20:05.971 --> 20:08.838
Hey, what were you doing?

20:08.907 --> 20:10.499
I'm sorry, everyone!

20:12.778 --> 20:14.268
Konoe-shama...

20:15.814 --> 20:18.146
We've rescued
Taro-sama safely.

20:18.217 --> 20:19.844
We will withdraw
from here quickly.

20:20.552 --> 20:21.541
Hurry!

20:21.620 --> 20:22.552
- Yes, ma'am.
- Yes, ma'am.

20:24.923 --> 20:28.222
Yashima, good work
on the sudden task.

20:30.095 --> 20:32.529
Leader, please come
with me for a bit.

20:32.598 --> 20:33.462
H-Hey...

20:35.701 --> 20:37.032
Hey, Yashima.

20:37.102 --> 20:37.898
What is it?

20:40.172 --> 20:42.970
Leader, you like
Taro-sama after all, right?

20:44.142 --> 20:45.632
Yashima...

20:45.711 --> 20:47.542
Why don't you tell him?

20:47.613 --> 20:49.137
If you don't, Taro-sama...

20:52.251 --> 20:54.742
My wish is to serve Taro-sama.

20:55.787 --> 20:57.448
To protect Taro-sama.

20:58.657 --> 21:00.818
So that Taro-sama
won't get hurt...

21:02.794 --> 21:04.193
Leader...

21:05.097 --> 21:08.931
Besides, Taro-sama doesn't
think of me as a woman.

21:10.235 --> 21:11.930
Leader...

21:12.004 --> 21:12.902
Let's go.

21:13.939 --> 21:14.871
Right.

21:18.944 --> 21:21.742
Anyway, he resembles
him very much...

21:21.813 --> 21:22.711
The boy...

21:22.781 --> 21:24.772
No, Taro Hanaukyo.

21:31.156 --> 21:33.624
May he overcome
the coming trial...

21:33.692 --> 21:36.286
Please let him capture the future.

21:46.305 --> 21:49.604
Warera ni omakase kudasai.

21:49.675 --> 21:51.802
Hanaukyo Maid Tai.

21:52.878 --> 21:56.006
Osewa sasete itadakimasu.

21:56.081 --> 21:59.175
Osoba goyo tai.

21:59.251 --> 22:02.345
Oki ni mesuyouni tsuneni.

22:02.421 --> 22:04.616
Yaruki runrun nandesu.

22:05.691 --> 22:08.854
Kokoro to karada wo migaki.

22:08.927 --> 22:11.862
Goyou nannarito.

22:11.930 --> 22:23.432
Yorokonde yorokonde
hoshii dake desu.

22:24.610 --> 22:35.179
Sorenanoni sorenanoni
tsurenai ohito.

22:37.422 --> 22:43.554
Hoshiga hora kirei desu.

22:43.629 --> 22:49.226
Asu mo hare deshou.

22:50.268 --> 22:56.605
Konya mone yume demone...

22:56.675 --> 23:00.941
...osewa shichau.

23:10.589 --> 23:13.490
Mariel, h-have you
ever gone on a date?

23:13.558 --> 23:14.525
No.

23:14.593 --> 23:15.685
I see...

23:15.761 --> 23:16.750
Um...

23:16.828 --> 23:19.490
Episode 9, The First Date.

23:19.564 --> 23:20.999
